{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0172-s001", "text": "I allmänhet måste man ansöka om uppehållstillstånd innan man flyttar till Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0172-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.35247802734375, "generation_seconds": 14.772788391914219, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0172-s002", "text": "Ett undantag är ändå ansökan om asyl, eftersom man kan ansöka om asyl endast i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0172-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.288787841796875, "generation_seconds": 24.25937585486099, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0172-s003", "text": "Om en person beviljas asyl, får hen uppehållstillstånd på basis av sin flyktingstatus.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0172-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.253936767578125, "generation_seconds": 23.977211290970445, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0172-s004", "text": "Med en asylansökan kan man också få uppehållstillstånd på grund av alternativt skydd eller till exempel individuella mänskliga orsaker.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0172-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.051156462585034, "peak": 0.50103759765625, "generation_seconds": 31.225606926018372, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0173-s001", "text": "Med internationellt skydd avses i Finland flyktingstatus eller status som alternativt skyddsbehövande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0173-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.05578231292517, "peak": 0.34454345703125, "generation_seconds": 22.434664427069947, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0173-s002", "text": "I utlänningslagen finns bestämmelser om grunderna och förfarandena enligt vilka internationellt skydd ges.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0173-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.195102040816327, "peak": 0.277587890625, "generation_seconds": 23.034052469069138, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0174-s001", "text": "Man kan ansöka om internationellt skydd genom att lämna in en asylansökan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0174-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.254669189453125, "generation_seconds": 14.479382188990712, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0174-s002", "text": "Migrationsverket utreder om en person har rätt till asyl.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0174-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.3153076171875, "generation_seconds": 17.86099009704776, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0174-s003", "text": "Om förutsättningarna för att få asyl uppfylls, beviljas personen uppehållstillstånd på grund av flyktingstatus.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0174-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.170340136054422, "peak": 0.347015380859375, "generation_seconds": 31.946605772012845, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0174-s004", "text": "Om förutsättningarna för att få asyl inte uppfylls, utreder man om personen har rätt till skydd i Finland enligt principen om alternativt skydd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0174-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.678095238095239, "peak": 0.338470458984375, "generation_seconds": 43.47542611300014, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0175-s001", "text": "En person kan få alternativt skydd om hen löper risk att utsättas för någon annan verklig och allvarlig fara än den förföljelse som ligger till grund för asyl.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0175-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.514013605442177, "peak": 0.445159912109375, "generation_seconds": 50.34958037803881, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0175-s002", "text": "En orsak till det kan vara hot om dödsstraff eller tortyr.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0175-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.332916259765625, "generation_seconds": 21.9256171931047, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0175-s003", "text": "En orsak kan också vara att personen utsätts för en allvarlig och personlig fara på grund av en väpnad konflikt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0175-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.752380952380953, "peak": 0.30615234375, "generation_seconds": 37.439540500054136, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0176-s001", "text": "Du kan söka asyl i Finland om du har välgrundad fruktan för förföljelse i ditt hemland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0176-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.283447265625, "generation_seconds": 31.921917636180297, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0176-s002", "text": "Orsaker till förföljelse kan vara etniskt ursprung, religion, medborgarskap, tillhörighet till en viss grupp i samhället eller politiska åsikter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0176-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.399455782312925, "peak": 0.29180908203125, "generation_seconds": 54.43590081715956, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0177-s001", "text": "När myndigheten har mottagit din asylansökan, hänvisas du till ett mottagningscenter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0177-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.453605442176871, "peak": 0.268218994140625, "generation_seconds": 32.68382383603603, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0177-s002", "text": "Där kan du bo under tiden då Migrationsverket behandlar din ansökan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0177-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.291351318359375, "generation_seconds": 27.405747174983844, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0177-s003", "text": "Du kan även bo någon annanstans, men då måste du själv bekosta boendet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0177-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.199727891156463, "peak": 0.254547119140625, "generation_seconds": 22.303545888047665, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0178-s001", "text": "I vissa situationer kan gränsmyndigheten lämna över din asylansökan till gränsförfarandet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0178-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.2681884765625, "generation_seconds": 26.27730307308957, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0178-s002", "text": "För detta måste det alltid finnas en laglig grund.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0178-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.32916259765625, "generation_seconds": 19.973999351961538, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0178-s003", "text": "Gränsförfarandet(rajamenettely) innebär att Migrationsverket behandlar ansökan vid ett påskyndat förfarande eller fattar beslut om att avvisa ansökan utan prövning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0178-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.001632653061224, "peak": 0.369873046875, "generation_seconds": 56.154799649026245, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0178-s004", "text": "I utlänningslagen (ulkomaalaislaki) definieras i vilka situationer Migrationsverket kan göra så.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0178-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.323699951171875, "generation_seconds": 34.54907675902359, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0179-s001", "text": "Gränsmyndigheten hänvisar dig till ett mottagningscenter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0179-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.28533935546875, "generation_seconds": 20.99531780811958, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0179-s002", "text": "Du måste bo där under den tid som gränsförfarandet pågår.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0179-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.25323486328125, "generation_seconds": 18.261044329963624, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0179-s003", "text": "Du får inte lämna mottagningscentrets område utan tillstånd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0179-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.253692626953125, "generation_seconds": 20.5945630162023, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0179-s004", "text": "Vid gränsförfarandet har du samma rätt till rådgivning och juridisk hjälp som andra asylsökanden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0179-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.2552490234375, "generation_seconds": 25.612791737075895, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0180-s001", "text": "Om du är under 18 år gammal och kommer till Finland som asylsökande utan vårdnadshavare, förordnas du ett ombud.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0180-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.797278911564625, "peak": 0.3594970703125, "generation_seconds": 35.68936321604997, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0180-s002", "text": "Ombudet är en pålitlig vuxen person som hjälper dig med olika ärenden under tiden då Migrationsverket behandlar din ansökan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0180-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.65795918367347, "peak": 0.405670166015625, "generation_seconds": 35.475479749031365, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0180-s003", "text": "Ombudet följer med dig när du ska prata med myndigheter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0180-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.015510204081632, "peak": 0.25439453125, "generation_seconds": 14.340810912894085, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0180-s004", "text": "Dessutom utreder ditt ombud om du kan återförenas med din familj.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0180-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.921088435374149, "peak": 0.27716064453125, "generation_seconds": 18.355853809043765, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0180-s005", "text": "Du har rätt till boende, mat och hälsovård.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0180-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.8312925170068026, "peak": 0.265228271484375, "generation_seconds": 10.658399756997824, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0180-s006", "text": "Du har även rätt att gå i skola.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0180-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.0650340136054424, "peak": 0.312652587890625, "generation_seconds": 10.210086907958612, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0181-s001", "text": "Migrationsverket handlägger din ansökan och fattar ett beslut.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0181-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.352081298828125, "generation_seconds": 15.529702877160162, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0181-s002", "text": "Migrationsverket utreder din identitet och resväg till Finland och bedömer om du kan beviljas asyl i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0181-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.752380952380953, "peak": 0.377410888671875, "generation_seconds": 24.41336568398401, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0182-s001", "text": "Det är vanligt att behandlingen av ansökan tar flera månader.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0182-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.363809523809524, "peak": 0.2794189453125, "generation_seconds": 13.579489148920402, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0182-s002", "text": "När du har sökt asyl har du rätt att vistas i Finland medan din ansökan behandlas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0182-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.2943115234375, "generation_seconds": 17.451040965039283, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0182-s003", "text": "Under denna tid kan du inte resa utomlands.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0182-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.319488525390625, "generation_seconds": 8.501138960011303, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0182-s004", "text": "Om du reser kan myndigheterna besluta att din ansökan inte längre gäller.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0182-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.478367346938776, "peak": 0.298126220703125, "generation_seconds": 13.45296146790497, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0183-s001", "text": "Som asylsökande har du rätt att använda ett rättsbiträde under samtalet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0183-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.38134765625, "generation_seconds": 14.262966768816113, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0183-s002", "text": "Biträdet deltar i asylsamtalet efter sitt eget omdöme.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0183-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.9458503401360545, "peak": 0.285430908203125, "generation_seconds": 11.76935037993826, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0184-s001", "text": "Under tiden då din ansökan behandlas kan du få rådgivning och rättshjälp vid den offentliga rättshjälpsbyrån.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0184-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.195102040816327, "peak": 0.290771484375, "generation_seconds": 20.826537672895938, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0184-s002", "text": "Kontakta rättshjälpsbyrån om du vill ha ett rättsbiträde.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0184-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.281829833984375, "generation_seconds": 13.034704888937995, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0184-s003", "text": "Vid behov hjälper mottagningscentret dig.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0184-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.31622314453125, "generation_seconds": 8.699782053008676, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0184-s004", "text": "Rättshjälpsbyrån (oikeusaputoimisto) kan även hänvisa dig till en privat jurist eller en privat juristbyrå.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0184-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.752380952380953, "peak": 0.315948486328125, "generation_seconds": 22.390948647167534, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0185-s001", "text": "Du kan även få rådgivning hos Flyktingrådgivningen rf (Pakolaisneuvonta ry).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0185-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.271942138671875, "generation_seconds": 14.239267067052424, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0185-s002", "text": "Flyktingrådgivningen ger rådgivning även till personer som vistas i Finland utan uppehållstillstånd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0185-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.258514404296875, "generation_seconds": 21.29538933816366, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0186-s001", "text": "Asylsökande har inte rätt till den sociala tryggheten i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-asyl/narration/hb-c12-u0186-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.424285888671875, "generation_seconds": 18.49914218694903, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
